00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:17,370
Now I will read lesson, you observe screen to know how to read instruction lesson by steps.

2
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:26,530
How to boil tasty eggs?

3
00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:33,680
Boiled egg dish is truly appealing to us right?

4
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:45,860
You - little chefs - can boil eggs yourself by following steps:

5
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:57,370
Step 1: Arrange eggs in pot.

6
00:00:58,710 --> 00:01:09,220
Step 2: Pour cold water into pot enough to cover eggs.

7
00:01:09,860 --> 00:01:19,950
Step 3: Boil eggs until water boils then lower heat, boil more about 5 minutes.

8
00:01:19,950 --> 00:01:31,280
Step 4: Take eggs out, soak in cold water then peel shell.

9
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:44,260
Now, you show talent to make this tasty and nutritious dish for family everyone!

10
00:01:45,420 --> 00:02:00,530
When reading instruction lesson by steps you read each step one by one.

